{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03137","headline":"南山下旧居闲放 · 张九龄","name":"南山下旧居闲放","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秪役已云久，乘闲返服初。\n块然屏尘事，幽独坐林闾。\n清旷前山远，纷喧此地疎。\n乔木凌青霭，修篁媚绿渠。\n耳和绣翼鸟，目畅锦鳞鱼。\n寂寞心还间，飘颻体自虚。\n兴来命旨酒，临罢阅仙书。\n但乐多幽意，宁知有毁誉。\n尚想争名者，谁云要路居。\n都忘下流叹，倾夺竟何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}